1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
She walked 12 km just to ask one question:
"Is this normal in pregnancy?"

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,500
For millions of village women,
the nearest doctor is hours away.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:10,000
The internet?
You're lucky if there's even a signal.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
That's why I built Sakhi,

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,000
an AI health friend that works offline,
on basic phones, in 6 languages.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
"Sakhi, my feet are swollen.
What should I do?"

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:27,000
"Rest with your feet raised. If your face or hands
also swell, or you have a headache, see a doctor right away."

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Just speak. No typing. No English needed.

9
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,500
Symptom checker

10
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,000
Pregnancy tracker

11
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,500
Nearest hospital

12
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:40,000
Nutrition scanner

13
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,000
SOS: help in one tap

14
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:46,000
"Sakhi" means friend.

15
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Every woman needs a friend who knows about health,
day or night, even without a signal.

16
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Know someone who needs Sakhi?
Send them this video.

17
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Follow to watch this journey 💛
